WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:09.000
Step 1: In Resend open API keys and click Create API key.

2
00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:16.000
Step 2: Name it, for example RevOps agent.

3
00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:23.000
Step 3: Keep Full access and All domains. The agent needs it once, to add your domain.

4
00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:28.000
Step 4: Click Add.

5
00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:35.000
Step 5: Copy the key with the copy icon. Resend shows it once.

6
00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:41.000
Step 6: In your centre, paste it into Resend API key.

7
00:00:41.000 --> 00:00:48.000
Step 7: Click Connect Resend. The agent adds your domain and writes its records in Cloudflare.
